Description: private peer and multi-provider cloud storage client
 TuxInDrive is a native desktop client for synchronizing, streaming and
 searching data across multiple cloud providers. It also supports encrypted
 peer collaboration, provider-linked profile migration, verified updates,
 policy-aware transfers and optional Nautilus integration.
